{"unit_id": "tag:035F:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为一个拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf），带有<MATH_0003>-代数（algebras）结构。子层（subsheaf）<MATH_0004>由如下规则定义，即<MATHSEG_0001>在<MATHSEG_0002>上为整（integral），对所有<MATHSEG_0003>均如此。它是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0005>-代数（algebra），茎（stalk）<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>在<MATH_0008>中的整闭包（integral closure），且对于任意仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0009>，环（ring）<MATH_0010>是<MATH_0011>在<MATH_0012>中的整闭包（integral closure）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "subsheaf", "target_term": "子层"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "integral closure", "target_term": "整闭包"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "integral closure", "target_term": "整闭包"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "用来描述引理中的底空间。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "用来描述假设中带有代数结构的层。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "用来描述假设中层所带的代数结构，保留原文复数形式。"}, {"source_term": "subsheaf", "target_term": "子层", "context": "用来描述按给定规则定义的层。"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "用来描述定义子层的逐点整性条件。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "用来描述所得代数层的性质。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "用来描述所得子层的代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎", "context": "指所得子层在一点处的茎。"}, {"source_term": "integral closure", "target_term": "整闭包", "context": "描述子层的茎在引理中的刻画。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指底概形中任取的仿射开子集。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "指引理在仿射开集上所述的环。"}, {"source_term": "integral closure", "target_term": "整闭包", "context": "描述仿射开集上的环在引理中的刻画。"}], "notes": []}
